Exception: Resurgamus Horizon brand skins
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Two demo files are brand assets of the separate Resurgamus Horizon project and
are NOT covered by the MIT license above. They remain licensed under the GNU
Affero General Public License v3.0 or later, as stated in their own headers:

